WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.026
<v><b>Narrator: </b><v>1 

00:00:02.116 --> 00:00:04.322
I booked the flights yesterday. 

00:00:05.833 --> 00:00:09.278
We arrived at the airport at 10.00 this morning.

00:00:11.122 --> 00:00:11.938
<v><b>Narrator: </b><v>2 

00:00:12.784 --> 00:00:16.139
When I was young I watched TV every night.

00:00:17.287 --> 00:00:20.884
I worked as a waiter every weekend when I was at university.